        },
        {
          "text": "Basi baadhi ya wanafunzi wake wakasemezana, Neno gani hilo asemalo, Bado kitambo kidogo nanyi hamnioni, na tena bado kitambo kidogo nanyi mtaniona? Na hilo, Kwa sababu naenda zangu kwa Baba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi walisema, Neno gani hilo asemalo; hilo, Bado kitambo kidogo? Hatujui asemalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu alifahamu ya kwamba wanataka kumwuliza, akawaambia, Ndilo hilo mnaloulizana, ya kuwa nalisema, Bado kitambo kidogo nanyi hamnioni, na tena bado kitambo kidogo nanyi mtaniona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amin, amin, nawaambia, Ninyi mtalia na kuomboleza, bali ulimwengu utafurahi; ninyi mtahuzunishwa, lakini huzuni yenu itageuka kuwa furaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
